[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469676277","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99082#issuecomment-2469676277","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99082","id":2469676277,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TNET1","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T06:01:00Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T06:11:05Z","body":"Have you validated that this doesn't have any performance overhead? A lot of the driver code contains relatively hot paths, so the impact of a performance regression will be more notable.\r\n\r\n_edit: I took a look myself. It seems that vformat comes with tons of overhead compared to what we are currently doing. I don't think we should be using this anywhere near hot paths._\r\n\r\n_vformat: first we convert all the arguemnts to variant, then copy them into an array of variants, then pass to sprintf_\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ec6a1c0e792ac8be44990749800a4654a293b9ee/core/variant/variant.h#L878-L892\r\n\r\nWhich calls ustring::sprintf which loops through all the characters and then manually converts the variant into a string and inserts it\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ec6a1c0e792ac8be44990749800a4654a293b9ee/core/string/ustring.cpp#L5584\r\n\r\nCompare that to the \"+\" operator which just does a `memcopy`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469676277/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469849727","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99082#issuecomment-2469849727","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99082","id":2469849727,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TNup_","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T08:09:02Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T08:09:02Z","body":"That's a good point, will close this one until I've done my performance improvements to the performance of `vformat`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469849727/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469861310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99082#issuecomment-2469861310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99082","id":2469861310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TNxe-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T08:15:12Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T08:15:12Z","body":"Note though that the error message is only evaluated *if* the error condition is triggered or the warning is actually printed, see the error macro:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ec6a1c0e792ac8be44990749800a4654a293b9ee/core/error/error_macros.h#L417-L422\r\n\r\nBut staying on the safe side with these and reopening when I've done my performance improvement on `printf` that I've been planning for these","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469861310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471398700","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99082#issuecomment-2471398700","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99082","id":2471398700,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TTo0s","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T19:32:02Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T19:32:02Z","body":"> Note though that the error message is only evaluated if the error condition is triggered or the warning is actually printed, see the error macro:\r\n\r\nThat's right, and when you are hitting the error condition you also have the overhead of printing the error to console etc. Which is why some some performance analysis is in order. It may be the case that the cost of vformat is a drop in the bucket compared to the other costs associated with printing an error. But that needs to be checked. \r\n\r\nAlso, since this is part of an effort to standardize a codestyle across the codebase, we need to consider whether it is worth having one codestyle for error messages and another for other parts of the code. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471398700/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471430516","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99082#issuecomment-2471430516","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99082","id":2471430516,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TTwl0","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T19:48:21Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T19:48:21Z","body":"> Also, since this is part of an effort to standardize a codestyle across the codebase, we need to consider whether it is worth having one codestyle for error messages and another for other parts of the code.\r\n\r\nThere's no distinction between error and non-error code enforced here, these are just the most clear and direct cases I chose to apply to, it's just that error cases are the most simple and numerous to apply on","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471430516/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471469041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99082#issuecomment-2471469041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99082","id":2471469041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TT5_x","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T20:05:28Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T20:09:00Z","body":"Now for the relative performance I don't know how we'd benchmark error printing itself directly, and I suspect there's some non-insignificant overhead already just by printing it to console etc.\r\n\r\nBut if the benchmarks are anything to go by using `vformat` takes about 19% longer, and will hopefully be improved by my planned improvements there","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471469041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]